[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10384.07, "timestamp": "02:53:04", "text": "それを学ぶ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10385.349, "timestamp": "02:53:05", "text": "彼らはそれができるのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10387.269, "timestamp": "02:53:07", "text": "好奇心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10390.469, "timestamp": "02:53:10", "text": "そして、知らない人がどのように知るか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10399.19, "timestamp": "02:53:19", "text": "昨日、新しい単語を覚えました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10401.83, "timestamp": "02:53:21", "text": "土地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10403.349, "timestamp": "02:53:23", "text": "えーと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10404.79, "timestamp": "02:53:24", "text": "あれって何て名前だったっけ？ああ神様"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10420.55, "timestamp": "02:53:40", "text": "次のような"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10426.63, "timestamp": "02:53:46", "text": "1秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10430.07, "timestamp": "02:53:50", "text": "うん、ライオンバードが最初だね。そう、まずは陸地だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10431.99, "timestamp": "02:53:51", "text": "そして私は気づいた、ああ、そうじゃない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10434.15, "timestamp": "02:53:54", "text": "ずっと昔に私が経験したこと？のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10437.429, "timestamp": "02:53:57", "text": "ルーターのkn"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10439.91, "timestamp": "02:53:59", "text": "なぜなら、人々は、"}]